    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc9fAdd in WishList!!\ud83d\udc9f</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867460/extras/7f48fa7fc1cf6377c63dd7b0590b668d.avif?t=1752826300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NTR Office: A classic adventure of love and challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story-oriented 2D pixel-art RPG, you will embark on a very emotional journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work at a poorly managed pharmaceutical company, where your girlfriend is your team lead, and stands up for you when your manager tries to give you a hard time. However, that sleazy manager has been eyeing your girlfriend for a while, and has been planning to take her away from you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The company's genius research professor, who is also your childhood friend, has also been a great help to you. However, her new assistant seems a bit suspicious...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must navigate and choose carefully so that both your relationship and your career remain safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play a hero that protects his lover and keeps the relationship from being ruined by the owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or... You can enjoy being cuckolded by your girlfriend and the manager! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make will take you to three different endings. Each decision will affect your happiness and future. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- About the Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867460/extras/2f17e2eb9f5e3d142f19161b11e779de.poster.avif?t=1752826300\" width=616 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867460/extras/2f17e2eb9f5e3d142f19161b11e779de.webm?t=1752826300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Saijou Yui\u00a0 (Team Lead)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your superior, she does her best to make your work smooth and bearable. As your girlfriend, she also stands up for you when the manager gives you a hard time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867460/extras/27dd07b5f0084d442a2a1c24cff1a1b1.avif?t=1752826300\" width=616 height=344 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takagi Shiho\u00a0 (Doctor)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a genius doctor and your childhood friend, she tries to look out for you during work by appointing you to be the salesperson in charge when the company creates a new medicine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867460/extras/8a211f0726a36cd9bc5b8ba3b374b2e4.avif?t=1752826300\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 meticulously designed graphics and sex scenes provide an immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All sex scenes have both Chinese and Japanese voiceovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different endings based on your choices: true love, cuckold, or... a mysterious ending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy looking at things through the eyes of someone being cuckolded, look no further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867460/extras/e18cbaafa3cc528fe4bb3b7aac47b31f.avif?t=1752826300\" width=616 height=360 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867460/extras/a29ba5b6cbb356819f9695e991cd9a84.avif?t=1752826300\" width=616 height=402 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867460/extras/7f48fa7fc1cf6377c63dd7b0590b668d.avif?t=1752826300\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NTR Office: A classic adventure of love and challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story-oriented 2D pixel-art RPG, you will embark on a very emotional journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work at a poorly managed pharmaceutical company, where your girlfriend is your team lead, and stands up for you when your manager tries to give you a hard time. However, that sleazy manager has been eyeing your girlfriend for a while, and has been planning to take her away from you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The company's genius research professor, who is also your childhood friend, has also been a great help to you. However, her new assistant seems a bit suspicious...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must navigate and choose carefully so that both your relationship and your career remain safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play a hero that protects his lover and keeps the relationship from being ruined by the owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or... You can enjoy being cuckolded by your girlfriend and the manager! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make will take you to three different endings. Each decision will affect your happiness and future. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- About the Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867460/extras/2f17e2eb9f5e3d142f19161b11e779de.poster.avif?t=1752826300\" width=616 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto